Package: gwrs
Type: Package
Title: Fast Geographically Weighted Regression and Selection
Version: 0.4.0.9006
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Bahadir",
      family = "Yuzbasi",
      email = "b.yzb@hotmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
    )
  )
Description: Fits geographically weighted regression with lasso, ridge,
    elastic net, smoothly clipped absolute deviation (SCAD), minimax concave
    penalty (MCP), and centered scaled-lasso regularization, together with
    least-absolute-deviation and partial-differential-equation-constrained
    GWR-KTDD extensions. Fast fitting, path, prediction, cross-validation, and
    diagnostic kernels use 'RcppArmadillo' and 'RcppParallel', reuse sparse
    nearest-neighbor structures, and avoid dense spatial weight or smoother
    matrices for scalable selection and analysis of large spatial data.
